category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Exception handling library for C (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libexception is an exception handling library for C. It uses the setjmp and
longjmp calls to build a stack of jump buffers and exceptions and provides high
level semantics implemented as macros to make exception handling in C
unobtrusive and easy to use."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/hollow/libexception
license: BSD-3-Clause
